   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "67a7b300-5a46-4c90-aa9a-ce276ff999b4",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Funding and campaign controls introduce an operational approval layer."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
